      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ReceiveCommits` (`git push origin HEAD:refs/for/\u003cbranch\u003e%publish-comments`) also validates draft comments using `PublishCommentUtil.findInvalidComments`, passing raw `comment.message` and `comment.message.length()` without calling `markdownImagesUtil.stripImages(comment.message)`.\n\nDrafts containing inline base64 images created in the UI (now allowed by this change) will still be withheld on `git push` with `WARNING: Comment validation failure: Comment size exceeds limit` unless `ReceiveCommits` also strips images.",
